{"suttaId":"thag7.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2008,2028],"vripara":"459"},"segments":{"thag7.1:0.4":"Sundarasamuddattheragāthā","thag7.1:1.1":"“Alaṅkatā suvasanā, māladhārī [mālābhārī (sī.), mālabhārī (syā.)] vibhūsitā;","thag7.1:1.3":"Alattakakatāpādā, pādukāruyha vesikā.","thag7.1:2.1":"“Pādukā oruhitvāna, purato pañjalīkatā;","thag7.1:2.3":"Sā maṃ saṇhena mudunā, mhitapubbaṃ [mihitapubbaṃ (sī.)] abhāsatha”.","thag7.1:3.1":"“Yuvāsi tvaṃ pabbajito, tiṭṭhāhi mama sāsane;","thag7.1:3.3":"Bhuñja mānusake kāme, ahaṃ vittaṃ dadāmi te;","thag7.1:3.5":"Saccaṃ te paṭijānāmi, aggiṃ vā te harāmahaṃ.","thag7.1:4.1":"“Yadā jiṇṇā bhavissāma, ubho daṇḍaparāyanā;","thag7.1:4.3":"Ubhopi pabbajissāma, ubhayattha kaṭaggaho”.","thag7.1:5.1":"“Tañca disvāna yācantiṃ, vesikaṃ pañjalīkataṃ;","thag7.1:5.3":"Alaṅkataṃ suvasanaṃ, maccupāsaṃva oḍḍitaṃ.","thag7.1:6.1":"“Tato me manasīkāro … pe … nibbidā samatiṭṭhatha.","thag7.1:7.1":"“Tato cittaṃ vimucci me … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti.","thag7.1:7.5":"… Sundarasamuddo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
